# ── Trade Scanner Config ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to config.env and fill in your own values.
# api.py reads config.env automatically on startup — no restart of scheduled
# tasks needed.
# Lines starting with # are comments and are ignored.

# ntfy.sh push notifications (free, no account required)
# 1. Install the ntfy app on your phone: https://ntfy.sh
# 2. In the app, tap Subscribe and enter your topic name below
# 3. Make the topic name unique (e.g. yourname-scanner-1234)
# 4. Save this file — alerts will activate on next api.py start
NTFY_TOPIC=your-scanner-topic-here
